// This file wires the workflow engine: the store opened by internal/repository, the authentication
// directory, the notification channels, the optional AI decider and the scheduler. | 本文件装配流程
// 引擎：由 internal/repository 打开的存储、鉴权目录、通知渠道、可选 AI 决策器与调度器。

package service

